## Graphics Assets

### Hi-Res Icon (required)

| Spec | Requirement |
|------|-------------|
| Size | **512 × 512 px** |
| Format | PNG (32-bit, with alpha) |
| Max file size | 1024 KB |

{% if store_assets.icon_source is defined %}
Source icon: `{{ store_assets.icon_source }}`
{% if icon_dimensions is defined %}
Current dimensions: {{ icon_dimensions.width }} × {{ icon_dimensions.height }}
{% if icon_dimensions.width >= 512 and icon_dimensions.height >= 512 %}
✅ Source is large enough — resize to 512×512 for upload.
{% else %}
⚠️ Source icon is too small. You need at least 512×512.
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% else %}
⚠️ No source icon configured. Add `store_assets.icon_source` to your config.
{% endif %}

### Feature Graphic (required)

| Spec | Requirement |
|------|-------------|
| Size | **1024 × 500 px** |
| Format | PNG or JPEG |

This is the banner image shown at the top of your store listing. Tips:
- Use your app name and a visual that conveys the core experience
- Keep text minimal — it will be shown at various sizes
- Tools: Figma, Canva, or any image editor
- Do NOT include device frames in the feature graphic

{% if store_assets.feature_graphic is defined %}
✅ Feature graphic configured: `{{ store_assets.feature_graphic }}`
{% else %}
⚠️ No feature graphic yet. Create a 1024×500 image and add `store_assets.feature_graphic` to your config.
{% endif %}

### Screenshots (required)

| Spec | Requirement |
|------|-------------|
| Minimum | **2 phone screenshots** |
| Recommended | 4–8 screenshots |
| Phone size | 16:9 aspect ratio (e.g., 1080×1920) |
| Tablet size | Recommended if targeting tablets |
| Format | PNG or JPEG, no alpha |
| Max per type | 8 screenshots |

#### Recommended Screens to Capture

{% if screens is defined and screens | length > 0 %}
{% for screen in screens %}
{{ loop.index }}. **{{ screen }}**
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
Review your app's screens and capture the most important user flows.
{% endif %}

Tips:
- Show the app in action, not empty states
- Consider adding device frames and captions using tools like [screenshots.pro](https://screenshots.pro) or Figma
- Capture in both light and dark mode if your app supports it
- Use a clean device with no notification bar clutter

{% if store_assets.screenshots is defined and store_assets.screenshots | length > 0 %}
✅ Screenshots configured: {{ store_assets.screenshots | length }} files
{% else %}
⚠️ No screenshots configured yet. Capture them and add paths to `store_assets.screenshots` in your config.
{% endif %}

